flowchart TD
  Owner[Authenticated owner] --> Intent[Private upload intent]
  Intent --> Staging[(Private staged object)]
  Staging --> Verify[Finalize: inspect real MIME, size, digest, ownership]
  Verify --> Linked[Ready asset attached to exact revision]
  Linked --> Publish[Approved published snapshot]
  Publish --> PublicMedia[Public derivative / authorized delivery]
  Visitor[Anonymous visitor] --> Contact[Validated, rate-limited contact]
  Contact --> Store[(Private stored message + outbox)]
  Store --> Receipt[Stored receipt: no email delivery promise]
  Store --> Notify[Retryable notification worker]
